ehukai (0.0.4-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Propagation::propagate can skip the folding metric (i_computeMinE), and
    propagateMinE fills it alone.
  * Fix a data race in CopyWrappedBorder that left a stale corner cell.
  * From 0.0.3: declare the Imath dependency as libimath-dev, make the
    Debian packaging opt-in and install package.xml.

 -- Carlos Aguero <caguero@honurobotics.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:44:16 +0000

ehukai (0.0.2-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * First release under the ehukai name: renamed repository, Debian
    packages (libehukai0, libehukai-dev), CMake package and C++ API.
  * Add a colcon manifest for workspace peer builds.
  * Default to an optimized build type when none is given.

 -- Carlos Aguero <caguero@honurobotics.com>  Wed, 12 Aug 2026 18:15:16 +0200

ehukai (0.0.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging via CPack (component-based library/dev split).

